You can also evaporate or freeze sections of the moat with wands or
spells of fire or cold. With a wand or two you should be able to get
around via the moat. Wands can be recharged with scrolls of charging,
too.

>>The trouble is there are at least two trapdoors, each time I try and
>>cross them I fall into them and back to level 31. Sigh. There are no
>>boulders around to push into the holes either.

..[Angus's polymorphing and cursed gain level solutions deleted]..

If you are strong, you can read a scroll of punishment and throw the
ball. This will drag you two spaces, and hence get you across the
trapdoors. If you don't have a scroll of punishment, you may be able to
write one if you have a magic marker.

